# math/ffi - provider-backed host floating-point math interop

@func floor
@template "floor(x)"
@help "Returns largest integer <= x."

@func ceil
@template "ceil(x)"
@help "Returns smallest integer >= x."

@func modulo
@template "modulo(a, b)"
@help "Returns Euclidean remainder for integral a and non-zero integral b."

@func sin
@template "sin(x)"
@help "Returns host-float sine of x in radians as an Aiki number."

@func cos
@template "cos(x)"
@help "Returns host-float cosine of x in radians as an Aiki number."

@func sqrt
@template "sqrt(x)"
@help "Returns host-float square root of x as an Aiki number."
